@title Text stress matrix: every case page, fitted and zoomed (look at the pictures for text on text)
@area Schematic
@slow
@sizes 1366x768
open qa/fixtures/text-stress-matrix.novo
wait 30
click_text Pages
wait 6
click 113 136
key ctrl+a
text symbols r0 part 1
wait 10
click 100 248
wait 20
key Escape
wait 4
key Home
wait 20
shot symbols-r0-part-1-fit
key ctrl+k
wait 6
text zoom to fit
wait 8
key Enter
wait 20
shot symbols-r0-part-1-zoom
